  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to implementing partners on EU financial management rules and procedures in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective (impact) to which this action contributes is to improve the capacity of EU funded grantees in contract and financial management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objective of this contract is to build the capacities of EU funded grantees to ensure stronger and more efficient systems, with measureable indices of performances in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;Stronger financial and internal systems control processes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;Efficient documentation management procedures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;Documented and compliant procurement procedures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;Capacity building for grantees on EU rules and procedures.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
